<title>GREECE: ONGOING ATHENS BOURSE RIGHTS ISSUES MAY-JUNE.</title>
<headline>ONGOING ATHENS BOURSE RIGHTS ISSUES MAY-JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are currently</p>
<p>running rights issues by Athens bourse listings.</p>
<p>The table is updated as new rights issues are cleared by the</p>
<p>Athens stock exchange.</p>
<p>    SHARE		    TERMS	  ISSUE	SUBSCRIPTION</p>
<p>						  PRICE	   PERIOD</p>
<p>						(in drs)</p>
<p>Michaniki	    2(c) and 2(p)    1,900(c)  May 09-June 09</p>
<p>-for-10 (c) or (p)  1,400(p)  Proceeds: 11.2 bln</p>
<p>Attica Enterprises     1-for-5	1,550     May 12-June 12</p>
<p>						Proceeds: 8.1 bln</p>
<p>Sarantis		   1-for-4	2,400     May 12-June 12</p>
<p>						Proceeds: 3.7 bln</p>
<p>Hellenic Technodomiki  1-for-1	1,400     May 15-June 17</p>
<p>					     Proceeds: 7.7 bln</p>
<p>Hellenic Invest	  3-for-10     1,900     May 23-June 23</p>
<p>						Proceeds: 6.4 bln</p>
<p>Ergo Invest		1-for-1	  450     May 26-June 26</p>
<p>						Proceeds: 7.4 bln</p>
<p>Avax			 4-for-10     1,200     May 30-June 30</p>
<p>					     Proceeds: 7.5 bln</p>
